# A pipe, as a three-slice.
#
# `nine: 0 0 6 6` — no horizontal insets at all, so this is a three-slice and
# not a nine: a pipe stretches vertically and never horizontally, and the six
# quads a full nine would emit for bands with no texels in them are six
# invisible instances. `NineSliceSource::expand` drops them for exactly this.
#
# **A cap at each end, and only one of them is ever seen.** A top pipe hangs
# from above the ceiling and a bottom pipe stands from below the floor, so the
# far cap is always outside the camera's band; making the art symmetric is what
# lets one image serve both without a flip the sprite pass does not have.
#
# The insets are 6 texels, so `minimum_size` is 12 texels = 0.6 world units.
# The shortest pipe the course can generate is
# `WORLD_CEILING - GAP_CENTRE_RANGE - GAP_HALF_HEIGHT` = 1.0 world units, so
# there is never a pipe the two caps cannot fit inside — `art.rs`'s
# `the_pipe_cap_fits_the_shortest_pipe_the_course_can_make` derives both sides
# and checks it rather than trusting this paragraph.
#
# The shaft is narrower than the caps because columns 0-2 and 29-31 are
# transparent on the shaft rows and opaque on the cap rows. The lip is the
# whole of that effect; there is no second sprite.
crpix: 32 24 1 5 1

palette:
  . c None
  k c #16300f
  l c #86d977
  g c #4faa46
  d c #2f7a34

frame pipe:
  kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk
  klllggggggggggggggggggggggggdddk
  klllggggggggggggggggggggggggdddk
  klllggggggggggggggggggggggggdddk
  klllggggggggggggggggggggggggdddk
  kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  ...kllggggggggggggggggggggddk...
  kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk
  klllggggggggggggggggggggggggdddk
  klllggggggggggggggggggggggggdddk
  klllggggggggggggggggggggggggdddk
  klllggggggggggggggggggggggggdddk
  kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk

nine: 0 0 6 6
sample: pixel
